Z||000003||Oreif||02-08-2001||09:39 AM||||The idea of the Fiero being mid-engine is to evenly distribute weight evenly between front and rear of car. Whay move the tank behind the rear wheels? If you want to install a monster sound system just buy a bigger car. There are many systems installed in Fiero's around here. Hell if your so strong on moving the gas tank, why not just remove the passenger seat? you can then fit 2 12" subs and all the amps you want into it.||||reg||1
